abstract: >-
  First public release of Cuba Geographic Data, introducing two datasets
  based on the official Código de la División Político-Administrativa
  (CoDPA): Administrative Geographic Names and Administrative Geometry.

  Administrative Geographic Names provides official province and municipality
  names and CoDPA codes, source cross-references, and point locations.

  Administrative Geometry provides administrative polygons linked to the
  corresponding geographic-name records.

  Both datasets are available as GeoParquet, GeoJSON, and GeoPackage and
  include ISO 19115-3 metadata.